{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"/usr/local/bin/galaxy-cli --help || true; echo '---'; head -100 /usr/local/bin/galaxy-cli\"","aggregated_output":"Usage: galaxy-cli [OPTIONS] [COMMAND] [ARGS]...\n\n  CLI harness for Galaxy bioinformatics platform.\n\n  Connect to a running Galaxy server and manage histories, datasets, tools,\n  workflows, and jobs from the command line.\n\n  Output mode:\n    Compact JSON is the default.\n    Use --human for human-readable terminal output.\n\n  Quick start (typical tool task):\n    source .env                      # set GALAXY_URL + GALAXY_API_KEY\n    galaxy-cli history create \"my run\"\n    galaxy-cli dataset upload data.tsv --history-id HID\n    galaxy-cli tool search \"cut columns\"\n    galaxy-cli tool show Cut1\n    galaxy-cli tool run Cut1 --history-id HID -i input=DSID --wait\n    galaxy-cli dataset show OUTPUT_ID\n\n  Quick start (workflow task):\n    galaxy-cli workflow import workflow.ga\n    galaxy-cli workflow show WF_ID\n    galaxy-cli workflow run WF_ID --history-id HID -i 0=DSID --wait\n\nOptions:\n  --url TEXT         Galaxy server URL\n  --api-key TEXT     Galaxy API key\n  --profile TEXT     Use a named profile from ~/.galaxy-cli/config.json for\n                     this command\n  --history-id TEXT  Override current history ID\n  --json / --human   JSON output (default) or human-readable output\n  --version          Show the version and exit.\n  --help             Show this message and exit.\n\nCommands:\n  collection  Manage dataset collections.\n  config      Manage Galaxy server connection settings.\n  dataset     Manage datasets in histories.\n  history     Manage Galaxy histories.\n  invocation  Manage workflow invocations.\n  job         Manage Galaxy jobs.\n  library     Manage shared data libraries.\n  profile     Manage multiple Galaxy server profiles (multi-instance...\n  session     Manage local CLI session state.\n  tool        Manage and run Galaxy tools.\n  user        User information and API key management.\n  workflow    Manage Galaxy workflows.\n---\n#!/bin/sh\nexec /opt/agent-venv/bin/galaxy-cli \"$@\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
